start: mr
R1: C1@{2ch=dc 16dc@ring ss@top}
R2: C2@{{2ch=dc dc}@same [2ch dctog ch dctog]x7 2ch dctog ch ss@top} # ch2+dc = first dc2tog
R3: C3@{ch sc@same [2ch {cl ch cl}@same 2ch sc@sp]x7 2ch {cl ch cl}@same 2ch ss@top}
R4: C4@{{2ch=sc dc tr 2ch tr dc}@same [4ch hdc 4ch {dc tr 2ch tr dc}@same]x3 4ch hdc 4ch ss@top}
R5: C1@{{2ch=sc 2dc 2ch 2dc}@same 2dc 4dc@sp sk 4dc@sp 2dc [{2dc 2ch 2dc}@same 2dc 4dc@sp sk 4dc@sp 2dc]x3 ss@top}
